; Table: Room Exits
;
; Six direction bytes for each room, in the order used by #R$C201:
; north, south, east, west, up, down. #N$00 means no exit. Some of
; these bytes are rewritten when a door opens or an event moves the
; player.
@label=Table_RoomExits
g$E934 DEFB $00      ; Direction #N((#PC-$E934)%$06) of room
                     ; #N((#PC-$E934)/$06): #N(#PEEK(#PC)).
